:SecondaryRole a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Secondary role"@en ;
    rdfs:comment """A secondary role within the procurement process that ties an agent to a part they play in a given situation.

Additional Information:

Secondary implies a lower level of involvement in the procurement process than a primary role.
It also implies a higher level of involvement in the procurement process than a tertiary role."""@en ;
