:TertiaryRole a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Tertiary role"@en ;
    rdfs:comment """A tertiary role within the procurement process that ties an agent to a part they play in a given situation.

Additional Information:

Tertiary implies a lower level of involvement in the procurement process than a primary and a secondary role."""@en ;
